    <guid isPermaLink="false">681b876bdb57cd35f70f9d9c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 08 May 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：Bin，Nadya，无头</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目在五一当天录制，录制的时候无头的面包刚好出炉，于是我们边吃面包边聊了很久的面包故事，还聊了一会有的没的，比如cos委托。</span></p><span></span><p><span>后半部分聊了聊最近玩的游戏，看的电影和剧，不知道大家五一快乐不快乐，反正我们聊的很快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Four80East - Noodle Soup</span></p><span></span><p><span>Four80East - Table for Two</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stereo MC's - Breeze</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jeff Lorber - Ain't Nobody</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Apostles - Mercy Mercy Me</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> nadya深圳见闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 电梯间的神秘对话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> 开始看母鸡卡了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 突然聊起来cos委托</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1872">31:12</a> 最近看了什么剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 没什么道理的出租车地域笑话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2350">39:10</a> 面包出炉，品尝一下</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVel8QaCfk-a2mlNA0dcdaSKRNZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi334oPIj5hJaVlwTiu2r2GgY8wR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3080">51:20</a> 开始吃面包了，面包吃完聊游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3210">53:30</a> 《犯罪现场清理员》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3454">57:34</a> 《Blue Prince》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3954">65:54</a> 《Unbeatable》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4145">69:05</a> “马拉松”《Marathon》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4523">75:23</a> 《苏丹的游戏》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4615">76:55</a>《双点博物馆》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4874">81:14</a>《明日方舟》萨卡兹肉鸽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5219">86:59</a> 《最后生还者2》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6048">100:48</a> 《夺宝奇兵》电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6300">105:00</a> 漫无目的瞎聊电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6672">111:12</a> 最后聊了聊环球影城，以及主题公园各种游乐设施和鬼屋的体验</span></p>]]></description>
